 See instructions in the [project's website](https://www.navidrome.org/docs/installation/)
 
+### Reverse proxy authentication
+
+Set `ReverseProxyWhitelist` to a comma-separated list of trusted proxy IP addresses or CIDR ranges, and set `ReverseProxyUserHeader` to the header carrying the authenticated username (default: `Remote-User`). For example, `ReverseProxyWhitelist = "192.0.2.0/24,2001:db8::/32"`. The special value `@` trusts connections through a Unix socket. An empty whitelist disables this feature. The proxy must remove client-supplied copies of the username header before adding its own; keep the whitelist limited to proxy addresses. The first user authenticated through the proxy becomes an administrator.
+
 ## Features
  
  - Handles very **large music collections**
